은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">사업의 실패 등</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">로 경제적 어려움을 겪는 학생들에게 다음과 같이 장학금을 지원하고자 하오니 해당 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신청대상</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가족구성원의 특이사유로 경제적 어려움을 겪는 학생</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">부모의 실직</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이혼</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">사업의 실패 등의 사유</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">장기간 병원입원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">치매환자 또는 말기암환자 발생 등의 사유</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;나</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">본인 및 부모의 장애로 생계가 어려운 학생</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기타 장학금 신청 사유가 충분하다고 판단되는 학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신청 전 학생처 상담필요</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">!</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">신청자격</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -23.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">직전학기 이수학점 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학점 이상이고 성적이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2.0</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">이상인 학생&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: -23.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&lt;2013</span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 신입생인 경우도 신청가능하며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-ascii-font-fami